# Normalise line endings to LF everywhere.
#
# Not cosmetic: .kit/manifest.json records a sha256 per file, and re-equip
# compares those hashes to decide "unmodified, safe to update" vs "locally
# edited, raise a conflict". Without this, the same file hashes differently on
# Windows and Linux, so every file would look edited and every re-equip would
# be one giant false conflict.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git must not touch
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.ai binary
*.eps binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
